# github-pages hosting for the Tesla partner public key
# Upload these files to a repo named <GITHUB-USER>.github.io, then enable GitHub Pages.
#
#   .nojekyll                                            <- this directory (root)
#   callback.html                                        <- root; OAuth redirect target
#   .well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem  <- generated by setup-key
#
# Verify after deploy:
#   curl https://<GITHUB-USER>.github.io/.well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem
